2403 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (Byte Club, the Computer Club of Bal Bharati Public School, \nPitampura, is back with the eighth iteration of its flagship \nannual tech fest, Byte.IT. The event aims to promote the \ndevelopment of technical skills such as programming, \nrobotics and web development among school students. The \nevent shall be attended by tech enthusiast students and \nteachers from the best schools across Delhi/NCR. Each \nparticipant will get a series of challenges which will put their\nabilities and STEM knowledge to the ultimate test. In 2019, at \nByte.IT, we introduced the ByteCTF, the first Indian Capture \nThe Flag \(CTF\) contest organised by and for high school \nstudents.)
/K [1]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 2404 0 R
/Pg 2242 0 R
>>
